      "content": "hey, i'm planning a solo trip to london soon and super excited. just wanted to get some advice on where to stay? i want to be in somewhere vibrant and diverse so i can experience the real city, but i'm also a bit nervous about solo travel so i don't want to end up in a sketchy area with way too much crime. any recs on good neighborhoods vs places i should probably avoid?",
